{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】美國總統特朗普從深圳啟程回國。</p>\n<p>中俄美三方會談結束後，特朗普晚上乘坐專車抵達深圳寶安機場，外長王毅在場送行，兩人在紅地毯上稍作停留及交談。特朗普之後再和其他在場送機的人士握手寒暄，才登上空軍一號，啟程返回美國馬里蘭州的安德魯斯空軍基地。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T11:36:31.003934+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T11:10:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T11:29:56.976939+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T11:29:56.976939+00:00","content_hash":"2ab9639dfba922ff21e2b131f7273a2f1ec769be75fba529df1b215e66ce43b7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}